  "name": "Cohere",
  "label": "Cohere",
  "description": "Official Cohere API (Chat v2 + Embed v2 + Rerank v2 + Tokenize v1) on the v2 agent model contract (INPUT llm_input → OUTPUT llm_output). Classify was removed: Cohere retired POST /v1/classify on 2025-09-25. Auth is StudioQuack secret api_key sent as Authorization Bearer. command-a-reasoning thinking content chunks stream on the thinking channel automatically. Image embed inputs use type file (platform ref-id). Docs: https://docs.cohere.com/reference/chat. Terms: https://cohere.com/saas-agreement. Never log api_key.",
  "icon": "psychology",
  "tags": [
    "cohere",
    "ai"
  ],
